### implementation summary

- Added `granted | suspended | revoked` grant lifecycle.
- `seedPolicy()` now:
  - inserts absent declarations as granted;
  - refreshes declaration fields only while granted;
  - cannot alter suspended/revoked rows or `is_active`.
- Added authenticated, transactional `transitionGrantState()`.
- Grant transitions require a reason and record actor/time/reason through `kernel.audit.record@1`.
- Authorization returns:
  - `grant_revoked`
  - `grant_suspended`
  - `role_not_allowed`
- Policy-version cloning preserves suspended/revoked states and refuses declaration edits to them.
- Added the authority-store ADR without migrating stores.
- Applied all twelve thesis changes.
- Removed test reliance on live tenant 54; tenant integration now requires isolated fixture 9054.

